# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Prime Logic Tech — Environment Variables
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# For local dev:   cp .env.example .env
# For Render:      These are set via the Render Dashboard OR render.yaml
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Django Core ──────────────────────────────────────────────
DEBUG=False
SECRET_KEY=replace-this-with-a-real-secret-key
ALLOWED_HOSTS=.onrender.com,localhost,127.0.0.1

# ── CORS (comma-separated frontend origins) ─────────────────
CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://primelogitech.vercel.app,http://localhost:5173,http://localhost:3000

# ── Port ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
PORT=8000

# ── Database (Render provides this automatically) ───────────
# DATABASE_URL=postgres://user:password@host:port/dbname

# ── Cloudinary (media storage — required for image uploads) ─
# CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=your-cloud-name
# CLOUDINARY_API_KEY=your-api-key
# CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET=your-api-secret

# ── Gmail SMTP (contact form emails — optional) ─────────────
# EMAIL_HOST_USER=your-email@gmail.com
# EMAIL_HOST_PASSWORD=your-16-char-app-password
# ADMIN_EMAIL=admin@example.com
